    {
      "id": "selectedFlight",
      "observations": [
        {
          "locale": "zh",
          "day": 1,
          "markers": 1,
          "text": "D1 浅草与藏前漫步\nTokyo\n2\n藏前街区\n+\n−\n Leaflet | © OpenStreetMap contributors\n游览顺序示意 · 非导航路线\n地图仅显示已有坐标的地点\n1\n下午\n浅草寺与仲见世商店街\n下午游览浅草寺，再沿仲见世商店街散步。\n尚未确认具体位置\n2\n晚上\n藏前街区\n晚上在藏前街区散步，观察沿街的传统工艺店与新店。\n街区级位置\n在规划记录中调整\n上午、下午等为建议游览时段。"
        },
        {
          "locale": "zh",
          "day": 2,
          "markers": 2,
          "text": "D2 上野文化与原宿小吃\nTokyo\n1\n2\n上野公园文化区\n+\n−\n Leaflet | © OpenStreetMap contributors\n游览顺序示意 · 非导航路线\n1\n上午\n上野公园文化区\n上午在上野公园文化区散步，感受博物馆周边的文化氛围。\n街区级位置\n2\n下午\n原宿竹下通\n下午漫步原宿竹下通，浏览街头服饰店并寻找小吃。\n街道级位置\n在规划记录中调整\n上午、下午等为建议游览时段。"
        },
        {
          "locale": "en",
          "day": 1,
          "markers": 1,
          "text": "D1 Asakusa and Kuramae walks\nTokyo\n2\nKuramae neighborhood\n+\n−\n Leaflet | © OpenStreetMap contributors\nVisit order · Not a navigation route\nOnly places with coordinates appear on the map.\n1\nAfternoon\nSensoji Temple and Nakamise Street\nVisit Sensoji Temple in the afternoon, then stroll along Nakamise Street.\nSpecific location not confirmed\n2\nEvening\nKuramae neighborhood\nWalk through Kuramae in the evening and explore its streets of traditional craft shops and newer stores.\nNeighborhood-level location\nAdjust in planning history\nMorning and afternoon are suggested visiting periods."
        },
        {
          "locale": "en",
          "day": 2,
          "markers": 2,
          "text": "D2 Ueno culture and Harajuku snacks\nTokyo\n1\n2\nUeno Park cultural area\n+\n−\n Leaflet | © OpenStreetMap contributors\nVisit order · Not a navigation route\n1\nMorning\nUeno Park cultural area\nSpend the morning walking through the cultural area of Ueno Park and around its museums.\nNeighborhood-level location\n2\nAfternoon\nTakeshita Street\nStroll along Takeshita Street in Harajuku in the afternoon, browsing fashion shops and looking for snacks.\nStreet-level location\nAdjust in planning history\nMorning and afternoon are suggested visiting periods."
        }
